    <!-- Icon layer. Every geometry is drawn on a 24x24 grid and is meant to be
         STROKED (never filled): the shapes are open polylines, so a fill would
         smear across the opening. IconPath below carries that contract.

         This dictionary is merged once at App level and never swapped by
         ThemeManager (whose marker is the "Themes/Theme." prefix), so icons stay
         available across dark/light switches. Colours come from DynamicResource
         references into the active theme. -->

